sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant LS as LayoutShell
    participant LSB as LeftSidebar
    participant CV as ChatView
    participant CH as ChatHeader
    participant CP as ChatPanel
    participant ML as MessageList
    participant CI as ChatInput
    participant CR as ContextRing
    participant OP as OutputPanel
    participant SD as ShareDialog
    participant Store as ChatStore(Pinia)
    participant API as Socket.IO / REST

    %% ── 场景 1：页面加载与初始化 ──
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over User,API: 场景1：应用启动 & 路由初始化

        User->>LS: 打开应用
        LS->>Store: registerSocket()
        Store->>API: WebSocket connect
        API-->>Store: socketReady = true
        LS->>Store: loadSessions()
        Store->>API: GET /sessions
        API-->>Store: sessions[]
        LS->>LSB: 渲染 LeftSidebar
        LSB->>Store: useSessionList → list (computed)
        Note over LSB: 显示分组任务列表

        LS->>CV: router-view → ChatView (path: /)
        CV->>CH: 渲染 ChatHeader
        CV->>CP: 渲染 ChatPanel
        CV->>OP: 渲染 OutputPanel
        CP->>ML: 渲染 MessageList (空态)
        CP->>CI: 渲染 ChatInput
    end

    %% ── 场景 2：发送消息完整流程 ──
    rect rgb(255, 250, 240)
        Note over User,API: 场景2：发送消息 → Agent 运行 → 产物生成

        User->>CI: 输入文本 + 点击发送
        CI->>CI: send() → text.trim()
        CI->>Store: sendMessage(text)
        Store->>Store: markLocalRun(sid)
        Store->>API: emit('run', { session_id, content })
        Store->>Store: messagesBySession[sid].push(userMsg)
        ML->>ML: 自动滚动到底部

        API-->>Store: run.started → runState[sid] = 'running'
        Store-->>CI: agentStates 更新 → busy
        CI->>CR: 传入 ctx_percent 更新环图颜色

        loop Agent 处理中
            API-->>Store: message.delta → 更新 assistant.content
            Store-->>ML: 响应式刷新消息内容
            ML->>ML: 持续滚动（流式输出）
        end

        API-->>Store: artifact.created → artifactsBySession[sid].push(artifact)
        Store-->>OP: 产物列表更新
        OP->>OP: 自动切换到新产物标签

        API-->>Store: run.completed → runState[sid] = 'idle'
        Store->>Store: settleLocalRun(sid)
        Store-->>CI: agentStates 更新 → idle
        API-->>Store: context.updated → contextBySession[sid]
        Store-->>CR: ctx_percent 更新
    end

    %% ── 场景 3：左栏切换会话 ──
    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over User,API: 场景3：左栏切换会话

        User->>LSB: 点击会话项
        LSB->>Store: openSession(newSid)
        Store->>Store: activeSessionId = newSid
        Store-->>CH: title 更新为新会话标题
        Store-->>ML: messagesBySession[newSid] 渲染
        Store-->>CI: modeBySession / modelBySession 更新
        Store-->>OP: artifactsBySession[newSid] 更新
        Store->>API: GET /context/{newSid}
        API-->>Store: contextBySession[newSid]
        Store-->>CR: 环图数据更新
    end

    %% ── 场景 4：右栏 OutputPanel 交互 ──
    rect rgb(255, 240, 255)
        Note over User,OP: 场景4：产物预览 & 全屏

        User->>OP: 点击产物标签
        OP->>OP: activeTabId = artifactId (v-show 切换)
        Note over OP: 渲染 iframe / AgentMarkdown / img

        User->>OP: 点击全屏按钮
        OP->>OP: fullscreen = true
        OP-->>CV: emit fullscreen → ChatView 隐藏 ChatPanel
        Note over OP: OutputPanel 覆盖中栏+右栏

        User->>OP: 编辑 URL 地址栏 + 回车
        OP->>OP: urlInput 变化 → iframe src 刷新

        User->>OP: 点击下载
        OP->>Store: 触发 artifact 下载

        User->>OP: 再次点击全屏
        OP->>OP: fullscreen = false
        OP-->>CV: 恢复三栏布局
    end

    %% ── 场景 5：分享流程 ──
    rect rgb(255, 255, 240)
        Note over User,SD: 场景5：分享任务

        User->>CH: 点击分享图标
        CH-->>CV: emit share
        CV->>SD: show = true (NModal)
        SD->>SD: generateUrl() → mock 分享链接
        Note over SD: 显示链接 + 过期时间 NSelect

        User->>SD: 选择过期时间 + 点击复制
        SD->>SD: copyLink() → navigator.clipboard.writeText()
        Note over SD: Toast 提示"已复制"

        User->>SD: 关闭弹窗
        SD->>SD: show = false
    end

    %% ── 场景 6：ChatInput [+] 面板添加上下文 ──
    rect rgb(245, 245, 255)
        Note over User,CI: 场景6：[+] 面板添加上下文

        User->>CI: 点击 [+] 按钮
        CI->>CI: NPopover show = true
        Note over CI: 显示技能/MCP/Agent/文件选择面板

        User->>CI: 搜索 + 选择技能
        CI->>CI: chips[] push { type:'skill', id, name }
        Note over CI: 输入框上方显示 chip 标签

        User->>CI: 点击 chip ×
        CI->>CI: chips[] splice(idx, 1)
        Note over CI: chip 移除
    end

    %% ── 场景 7：设置页导航 ──
    rect rgb(250, 245, 240)
        Note over User,API: 场景7：设置页 12 分类导航

        User->>LSB: 点击「设置」
        LSB->>LS: router.push('/settings')
        LS->>API: 懒加载 SettingsView.vue
        Note over LS: 渲染 LeftSidebar + SettingsView

        User->>API: 点击「模型管理」分类
        Note over API: scrollIntoView + activeId 高亮
        API->>Store: loadModels()
        Store-->>API: ProviderGroup[] 渲染
    end
